---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { BOOKING_URL } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Fees & Insurance"
  description="Session fees, insurance, payment, and cancellation policy at Release Wellness."
>

  <article class="container-narrow section fees">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">Fees &amp; Insurance</p>
      <h1>An investment in yourself. Because you are worth it.</h1>
      <p class="lede muted intro">
        Healing is an investment in yourself, your nervous system, your
        relationships, and your ability to move through life with more ease. My
        goal is to make this process feel clear and supportive from the start.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>Session fees</h2>
      <ul class="fee-list">
        <li>
          <span class="fee-label">Individual therapy</span>
          <span class="fee-amount">$185 / 50-min session</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="fee-label">Couple or family therapy</span>
          <span class="fee-amount">$225 / 50-min session</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Sessions are tailored to you and may include a blend of EMDR,
        somatic (body-based) work, sound healing, aromatherapy, and
        nature-based approaches, supporting nervous system regulation and
        embodied integration.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>Insurance</h2>
      <p>I am currently out-of-network with insurance.</p>
      <p>
        If you have a PPO plan, you may be eligible for partial reimbursement.
        I can provide a superbill for you to submit to your insurance provider.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>Payment</h2>
      <p>Payment is due at the time of service.</p>
      <p>I accept all major credit and debit cards.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>Cancellation policy</h2>
      <p>Your session time is held just for you.</p>
      <p>
        If you need to cancel or reschedule, please provide at least 24 hours
        notice. Late cancellations or missed sessions may be charged the full
        session fee.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>Good Faith Estimate</h2>
      <p>
        Under the federal No Surprises Act, you have the right to a Good Faith
        Estimate of expected charges before beginning care. <a href="/good-faith-estimate">Learn more about your right to a Good Faith Estimate &rarr;</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="cta-card">
      <h2>Getting started</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Finding the right therapist matters. If you'd like to see if this feels
        like a good fit, you're welcome to schedule a consultation.
      </p>
      <a
        href={BOOKING_URL}
        class="btn btn-primary"
        data-cta="book-consult"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Book a Consult
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>

</Base>

<style>
  .fees header { margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); }
  .fees header .eyebrow { margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs); }
  .fees .intro { margin-top: var(--space-md); }

  .prose { margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs);
  }

  .fee-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 var(--space-md);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  }
  .fee-list li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    padding-block: var(--space-sm);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  }
  .fee-label { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.125rem; }
  .fee-amount { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--color-sage-deep); }

  .cta-card {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    background: var(--color-sage-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .cta-card h2 { font-size: var(--fs-h2); }
</style>
